    <section class="page-section" id="faqs-section">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Consumer Knowledge Base</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Important regulatory and procedural information regarding automotive CNG cylinder hydro testing.
      </p>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.35rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0a1128; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">
            Why is CNG cylinder hydro testing mandatory every 3 years?
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Under Rule 35 of the Gas Cylinders Rules (2016) and Central Motor Vehicles Rules (CMVR), all automotive CNG cylinders must undergo hydrostatic water-jacket expansion testing every 3 years. Without a valid PESO certificate and brass plate, CNG filling stations will deny fuel, and vehicle fitness renewals are blocked.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.35rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0a1128; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">
            Why do CNG fuel pumps refuse to fill gas in my vehicle?
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            CNG stations operate at 200 Bar pressure. Attendants are statutorily required to check the brass compliance plate riveted near the fuel filling valve. If the 3-year validity date has passed or the plate is missing/damaged, fuel filling is immediately blocked for safety.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.35rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0a1128; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">
            What documents do I need to bring for the test?
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Bring your original vehicle Registration Certificate (RC) and an identification document (Aadhaar or Driving License). If a previous hydro test was conducted, bring the old compliance plate or certificate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.35rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0a1128; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">
            What is the booking advance and cancellation policy?
